UID:mesa-az-2028-11-prep@local-ballot-buddy
DTSTAMP:20261123T030144Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280710
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280711
SUMMARY:Get ready: 2028 general election in 120 days
DESCRIPTION:On the ballot:\n- City: Mesa mayor and council Districts 1\, 2 
 and 3 (runoffs only\, if the primary doesn't decide them) (expected\, not 
 yet official)\n- School district: School board seats and any district bond
  or override measures (expected\, not yet official)\n- County: County offi
 ces in every county (supervisors\, recorder\, sheriff\, county attorney\, 
 assessor\, treasurer\, school superintendent)\n- State: All 90 state legis
 lature seats\n- State: Three Corporation Commission seats\n- State: Statew
 ide ballot measures\, if any qualify (expected\, not yet official)\n- Fede
 ral: President\n- Federal: U.S. Senate (the seat Mark Kelly holds)\n- Fede
 ral: All nine U.S. House seats\nSee your exact ballot at https://my.arizon
 a.vote\n\nTap the link to check your address\, see your ballot\, and make 
 a plan.\nhttps://chatgpt.com/?q=Help%20me%20get%20ready%20for%20the%20Gene
 ral%20election%20on%202028-11-07.%20I%20live%20in%20Mesa.\n\nCity info: ht
 tps://www.mesaaz.gov/Government/City-Clerk/Elections\nCheck your registrat
 ion: https://my.arizona.vote
URL:https://chatgpt.com/?q=Help%20me%20get%20ready%20for%20the%20General%20
 election%20on%202028-11-07.%20I%20live%20in%20Mesa.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
